{"id":"proposicio_n","lemma":"proposición","pos":"noun","rank":4811,"glosses":["proposition"],"ipa":"/pɾoposiˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"proposiciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-proposici%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él estuvo a favor de la proposición.","en":"He was in favor of the proposition.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/937569","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,null,null,{"g":"the / her"},null],"phrases":[[2,5,"in favor of"]]},{"text":"Creo que no aceptará la proposición.","en":"I think he won't accept the proposal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687733","words":[{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to accept","l":"aceptar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Dudo que la nueva proposición sea aceptada.","en":"I doubt the new proposal will be accepted.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/691412","words":[{"g":"to doubt","l":"dudar"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"news, novelty"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Nadie apoyó su proposición.","en":"No one supported his motion.","words":[{"g":"no one"},{"g":"to lean","l":"apoyar"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"Apoyo la proposición.","en":"I second the motion.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799034","words":[{"g":"support"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}